==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Darumaka|17}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.
*'''Reckless Charge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Movie VS Pack|Ash's Phanpy|4}} from the {{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack: Aura's Lucario}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

